; DIMANGULAR in 0.8 takes lines only: an arc, a circle and Enter give
; Object selected is not a line. and the prompt again (PT27, #715).
; Lines from the vertex 0,0 to 40,0 and to 30,40 (angle 53.13 degrees), picked in this order;
; AutoCAD stores the first line picked as 15->10 and the second as 13->14 (autocad-quote.dxf, C8).
; Text centre on the bisector, DIMGAP + DIMTXT/2 = 1.875 above the arc in the reading direction
; (PT23 point 4, PT24 point 1; autocad-quote.dxf C8: R + 1.875 on the bisector).
LINE
0,0
40,0

LINE
0,0
30,40

ARC
-60,10
-50,20
-40,10
CIRCLE
-50,-30
10
DIMANGULAR
-50,20
-40,-30

20,0
15,20
; cambia con #930
30,10
